P3, the forms/xforms part (owner-approved 2026-10-18): backport of the forms hunk of
upstream LibreOffice c3355f20dcd5 (= 6b218b521d38 on libreoffice-26-2), "don't bother
loading exotic protocols for document-supplied data". An XForms model no longer loads
an instance document from an exotic-protocol URL the document supplies
(forms/source/xforms/model.cxx, Model::loadInstance).

Carried separately from the sc hunks (*calc-data-provider-hardening-backport-wasm-
spreadsheets.patch) because forms/ is compiled into every module, so it is built in
FG-072's all-module cycle. Unconditional, like upstream.

